      "problemStatement": "Build a full-featured, accessible **Drag and Drop Kanban Board** component in React/TypeScript using native HTML5 Drag and Drop APIs (`draggable`, `onDragStart`, `onDragOver`, `onDrop`). ### Key Requirements 1. Render multiple status columns (`To Do`, `In Progress`, `Done`). 2. Allow dragging cards between columns or reordering cards within the same column. 3. Highlight active drop zones when dragging cards over target columns. 4. Support keyboard navigation accessibility (`Tab` to card, `Space` to pick up, `Arrow Keys` to move, `Enter` to drop). 5. Persist state updates cleanly via React props/state.",
