      "problemStatement": "Implement a `Tabs` component — `Tabs({ tabs })`, where each tab is `{ id, label, content }` — following the WAI-ARIA Tabs pattern: clicking a tab activates it, and with focus anywhere in the tablist, `ArrowLeft` /`ArrowRight` move both focus *and* selection to the previous/next tab (wrapping around at the ends), and `Home`/`End` jump to the first/last tab.",
      "input": "`tabs`: an array of `{ id: string, label: string, content: ReactNode }`.",
