      "solved": false,
      "attempted": false,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "questionType": "coding",
      "problemStatement": "Implement `myBind`, a polyfill for `Function.prototype.bind`. Attached to `Function.prototype`, `fn.myBind(thisArg, ...boundArgs)` must return a new function that, when called, invokes `fn` with `this` permanently set to `thisArg` and `boundArgs` prepended to whatever arguments the returned function is called with — and any of those must not be overridable later (e.g. calling `.call()` on the bound function must not change its `this`).",
      "input": "`thisArg`: the value `this` should be permanently bound to inside `fn`; `...boundArgs`: zero or more arguments to permanently prepend to every",
