      "questionType": "coding",
      "problemStatement": "Implement `promiseAll(promises)`, a polyfill for `Promise.all`. Given an iterable of promises (or plain values), it should return a single promise that resolves with an array of all resolved values, in the same order as the input, once every input has settled successfully. If *any* input promise rejects, the returned promise must reject immediately with that same rejection reason, without waiting for the others to settle.",
