      "typescriptSolution": "function rotate(nums, k) {\n  const n = nums.length;\n  k = k % n;\n\n  function reverse(start, end) {\n    while (start < end) {\n      [nums[start], nums[end]] = [nums[end], nums[start]];\n      start++;\n      end--;\n    }\n  }\n\n  reverse(0, n - 1);\n  reverse(0, k - 1);\n  reverse(k, n - 1);\n}",
      "timeComplexity": "- **Time Complexity:** `O(N)` — 3 linear sub-reversals. - **Space Complexity:** `O(1)` — in-place pointers.",
