      "problemStatement": "Given an integer array `nums`, return the length of the **longest strictly increasing subsequence**. A **subsequence** is a sequence that can be derived from an array by deleting some or no elements without changing the order of the remaining elements. Could you improve the time complexity to `O(n log n)`?",
