      "problemStatement": "You are given a network of `n` nodes, labeled from `1` to `n`. You are also given `times`, a list of travel times as directed edges `times[i] = (u_i, v_i, w_i)`, where `u_i` is the source node, `v_i` is the target node, and `w_i` is the time it takes for a signal to travel from source to target. We will send a signal from a given node `k`. Return the **minimum time** it takes for all the `n` nodes to receive the signal. If it is impossible for all the `n` nodes to receive the signal, return `-1`.",
