      "problemStatement": "Write a function `ladderLength(beginWord, endWord, wordList)` that returns the number of words in the shortest transformation sequence from `beginWord` to `endWord`, where each step changes exactly one letter and every intermediate word must exist in `wordList`. Return `0` if no such sequence exists.",
      "input": "`beginWord`, `endWord`: strings of equal length. `wordList`: an array of candidate words (all the same length as `beginWord`).",
