      "questionType": "coding",
      "problemStatement": "Given an array of strings `strs`, group the anagrams together. An anagram is a word formed by rearranging the letters of another word, using all the original letters exactly once. Return the groups in any order.",
      "input": "`strs`: an array of strings.",
      "output": "An array of arrays of strings — each inner array is one anagram group.",
