      "problemStatement": "Given an integer array `nums` and an integer `k`, return the `k`th largest element in the array. Note that it is the `k`th largest element in the sorted order, not the `k`th distinct element. Can you solve it without sorting the array in `O(n log k)` or `O(n)` average time complexity?",
