      "questionType": "coding",
      "problemStatement": "Given an integer array `nums` and an integer `k`, return the `k` most frequent elements. You may return the answer in any order.",
      "input": "`nums`: `number[]` — array of integers; `k`: `number` — target count of top frequent elements",
      "output": "`number[]` — array of `k` most frequent elements",
