      "problemStatement": "Write a function `mergeTwoLists(list1, list2)` that merges two sorted linked lists into a single sorted list by splicing together the nodes of the first two, and returns its head.",
      "input": "`list1`, `list2`: heads of two linked lists, each already sorted in ascending order (either may be `null`).",
