          "input": "See usage example below",
          "output": "const list = buildList([1, 2, 3, 4]);\nreorderList(list);\n// list, walked node by node, now holds: [1, 4, 2, 3]\n\nconst list2 = buildList([1, 2, 3, 4, 5]);\nreorderList(list2);\n// list2, walked node by node, now holds: [1, 5, 2, 4, 3]",
          "explanation": "Derived from the documented API usage (class/multi-call example, not a single input/output pair)."
