      "problemStatement": "You are given an `n x n` 2D `matrix` representing an image, rotate the image by **90 degrees (clockwise)**. You have to rotate the image **in-place**, which means you have to modify the input 2D matrix directly. **DO NOT** allocate another 2D matrix and do the rotation.",
      "input": "`matrix`: `number[][]` — 2D square $N \\times N$ matrix",
