      "dryRun": "| `priceInput` | `taxInput` | `price` (number) | `taxPercent` (number) | `taxAmount` | `total` | Result |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| `\"100\"` | `\"10\"` | `100` | `10` | `10` | `110` | `\"Total: $110\"` |",
      "javascriptSolution": "function calculateTotal(priceInput, taxInput) {\n  const price = Number(priceInput);\n  const taxPercent = Number(taxInput);\n\n  if (Number.isNaN(price) || Number.isNaN(taxPercent)) {\n    return \"Total: $0\";\n  }\n\n  const taxAmount = price * (taxPercent / 100);\n  const total = price + taxAmount;\n\n  return `Total: $${total}`;\n}",
