      "deepExplanation": "Since ES2015, the spec guarantees a precise enumeration order for own properties: all integer-like keys first (sorted ascending numerically, e.g. '0', '1', '2'), then string keys in insertion order, then symbol keys in insertion order. This applies to `Object.keys()`, `for...in`, `JSON.stringify()`, and `Object.entries()`.",
      "productionExample": "```js\nFollow standard modern practices.\n```",
