      "deepExplanation": "RTL explicitly avoids testing implementation details like state variables, internal component method names, or wrapper component trees. By preferring screen.getByRole('button', { name: /submit/i }) and userEvent.click(), tests remain resilient to refactoring while validating true user-facing accessibility behavior.",
